{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2025-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1743465600, "end_date": 1746057599, "month_true_total": 19, "quota": 19, "returned": 19, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:24:49 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "193922256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198797846989", "personaname": "Dark&Flame", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198797846989/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 30, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1675031510, "avatar": "0202551a78241868dcb94f244e911f17c906e24e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arbitration acts to play games added after you buy them shouldn't be allowed. Now I can't play the game cos I don't wanna give legal rights up", "timestamp_created": 1746037749, "timestamp_updated": 1746037749, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557098388671875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193866181", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076156110", "personaname": "cron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cron-vk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 993, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 993, "last_played": 1745953291, "avatar": "3aaebd681ca9239fcf6fbe8163a5c7adbaa2536c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love this game, it has beautiful pixel art and engaging gameplay.\n\nBut I can't recommend it for the lack of long term support.\nThe game is 32 bits, long overdue an architecture upgrade, still features plenty of game breaking bugs and CTDs, especially on Linux where launching the game without Steam doing the heavy lifting is absurdly hard, check t