"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 5}, {"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "193834274", "author": {"steamid": "76561198218100677", "personaname": "HoneyBadger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198218100677/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 3664, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3615, "last_played": 1748939020, "avatar": "56b2c9e9a4948a35819b8f9ea2140fd95263cfc6"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is fun and has a great soundtrack 10/10 my review doesn't do the game justice", "timestamp_created": 1745925925, "timestamp_updated": 1745925925, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193616553", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075918633", "personaname": "Ronnoc", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198075918633/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3986, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3972, "last_played": 1745893015, "avatar": "5c9c5f64464e3f0dbb640d0db53379a5517a7e8e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought this game because it was on sale for like $2 and as of writing this review I have all of the steam achievements and am currently working my way through every unlockable thing in the game. I don't know why this has become so important to me. Maybe it's because I've been pushing away reality for the last month or maybe it's because of the news I got from the doctor. Either way. If you want to ignore the world around you and instead spend it staring at a pixelated 2D world where you embody small shape that vaguely resembles someone who just fell out of orbit. Then this is the game for you.\n\nAt first you will die, over and over and over and over...and then suddenly you won't. Suddenly you will be running around with a stack of 100x crowbars and 20x Drones, instaggibing any ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ pixel that moves around you and everything will be ok. Never mind paying bills or showering. Forget about making love to your partner (real, innanimate or handy), forget about anything other than dreams of red chests and white t shirts. Nothing matters any more, only survival.", "timestamp_created": 1745662154, "timestamp_updated": 1745679370, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193565295", "author": {"steamid": "76561199119308417", "personaname": "nomSlime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199119308417/", "num_games_owned": 68, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2687, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2687, "last_played": 1737837554, "avatar": "8ed7e4273c35b23c78a533d0116fa9a2bf4ebf90"}, "language": "english", "review": "take 2 seems to have put a extreamly intrusive Eula into this ( the same one wich ruins borderlands) due to how bad it is i can no longer recomend or play the game i payed for\nthis video explains it better than i could\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vMKMhqKzHxs\n\n(yes this is the 3rd time i post this review under a ROR game because even this game has been infested by take 2)", "timestamp_created": 1745601175, "timestamp_updated": 1745685948, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193526885", "author": {"steamid": "76561199724717108", "personaname": "AARAVOS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199724717108/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 43086, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23055, "last_played": 1774203964, "avatar": "ce63c7e529337d7cea8437cb02cb02190bc294b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I LOVE THE SUPER POWERS this game allows you to get! THE MONSTERS ARE COOL! SOUND TRACK IS ONE OF THE BEST! AND I DON'T CARE WHAT ANYONE SAYS, THE COMMANDO IS THE BEST PLAYER (thats why you start with  him first I believe)! - However !!!!!!! - There should have been A LOT MORE maps corresponding to the overly powered powers the player can achieve. This way the more maps, the more level of difficulty corresponding to the overly powered powers the player has and it should level out and balance the overly powered powers in making it more intense and as well as more fun! THERE Were a lot of glitches where I got stuck on the map and wasnt able to move - I have no idea how that was possible which killed my 3 days in a row of playing to get all artifacts and items and players etc... BUT OVERALL GAME WAS GREAT and it is even better playing it multiplayer with friends! I am hoping to get the RISK OF RAIN RETURNS when there is a sale on it!", "timestamp_created": 1745552896, "timestamp_updated": 1745552896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193505836", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018892742", "personaname": "Godspiel", 