ne.\r\nIf Acrid has no fans, then I do not exist.\r\nIf the world is against Acrid, then I am against the world.\r\nUntil my last breath I will play Acrid.", "timestamp_created": 1744051777, "timestamp_updated": 1744051777, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192205895", "author": {"steamid": "76561199191667707", "personaname": "RedstoneEV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199191667707/", "num_games_owned": 163, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 824, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 360, "last_played": 1788964788, "avatar": "64455b3f80e6419b182bf68c483de214f5f56d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game, rorr and ror2 are better tho", "timestamp_created": 1744017563, "timestamp_updated": 1744017563, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192039067", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202318513", "personaname": "David", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mebottle/", "num_games_owned": 415, "num_reviews": 312, "playtime_forever": 864, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 136, "last_played": 1745272484, "avatar": "3593ddbff08f1c82e8fdb01ff0df932743effbed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can see your legs.", "timestamp_created": 1743855467, "timestamp_updated": 1743855467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.565217375755310059", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192003553", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995436735", "personaname": "Eye of the Beholder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995436735/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 220, "playtime_forever": 263, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 263, "last_played": 1743815027, "avatar": "fbb7f96a3d40865edfd77243524543bf62214d7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "dated and it shows", "timestamp_created": 1743815042, "timestamp_updated": 1743815042, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.334932059049606323", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "191868420", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000807992", "personaname": "Stojke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000807992/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 4784, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4784, "last_played": 1732285913, "avatar": "8ea1c2c778d1997bafa8311895152b36aebb88d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "🌧️ Risk of Rain isn’t about balance.\nIt’s about overwhelming odds, hopeless battles, and stubborn survival.\n\nYou don't defeat Risk of Rain.\nYou outlast it, second by second, sprint by sprint, in a world that scales faster than you can breathe.\n\nThe planet doesn’t care.\nThe clock doesn’t care.\nThe swarm doesn’t care.\nOnly you care — and that’s why you keep moving.\n\nEvery item, every survivor, every mad dash to the teleporter isn’t about power.\nIt’s about carving seconds of existence out of chaos.\n\n🎮 Why Risk of Rain still matters:\n\n⚔️ Fast, brutal combat — where hesitation is death.\n🛠️ Endless stacking of items — turning small victories into wild, desperate survivals.\n🌌 Perfect scaling pressure — the world never waits, the world never weakens.\n🧠 Survivors that completely change how you play — every run feels different, even when you lose.\n🎵 A soundtrack that feels lonely, heavy, and quietly magnificent.\n\nThings I mastered in Risk of Rain:\n\n• The planet never forgives hesitation.\n• Greed isn’t an option — it’s a death sentence.\n• Teleporters are lifelines and death traps.\n• Movement is more important than firepower.\n• Some victories happen because you sprinted at exactly the right second.\n\n💬 TL;DR:\nRisk of Rain isn’t about being prepared.\nIt’s about adapting faster than the planet can kill you — and refusing to let the rising storm erase your existence.\n\nYou will die.\nYou will blame yourself.\nYou will run again — not because you expect to survive,\nbut because you refuse to surrender.\n\n🔥 Final Verdict:\n10/10. Would sprint through collapsing skies and gamble everything for one more breath of survival.\n\n🛠️ Special respect to the Risk of Rain modding community —\nthose who extended the storm, sharpened the survivors, and built new paths through chaos.\nYour creativity didn’t just expand the game — it expanded the spirit of survival itself. 🚀🌧️", "timestamp_created": 1743679695, "timestamp_updated": 1744314216, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.633536934852600098", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191810835", "author": {"steamid": "76561199002010386", "personaname": "Egocentrism Enjoyer", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AutisticGroceryBag/", "num_games_owned": 76, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 48, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23, "last_played": 1765010933, "avatar": "5db203cdd7b9c6b82b3b743d19d3065f506f6f75"}, "language": "english", "review": "Surprisingly it's not the 2013th game in the series", "timestamp_created": 1743610423, "timestamp_updated": 1743610423, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.543379008769989014", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191776518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112848295", "personaname": "Loksuk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Loksuk/", "num_games_owned": 38, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 242, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 216, "last_played": 1745380585, "avatar": "8b8b0e85e7c3891c0f6219d67b52ac155f7acfcd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Classic good many hours inc", "timestamp_created": 1743567443, "timestamp_updated": 1743567443, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191774186", "author": {"steamid": "76561198216366389", "personaname": "ZoosmellPoop", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198216366389/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 3041, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2671, "last_played": 1756787490, "avatar": "2cdae6c083243e947298a4558711e4384b066c01"}, "language": "english", "review": "jellyfish", "timestamp_cr